e>Detmar</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tumor lymphangiogenesis: A novel prognostic indicator for cutaneous melanoma metastasis and survival</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>2003</year><volume>162</volume><fpage>1951</fpage><lpage>1960</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Am J Pathol||162|1951||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12759251</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The inter-relationship of hematogenous and lymphatic tumour cell dissemination</article-title><source>Surg Gynecol Obstet</source><year>1966</year><volume>122</volume><fpage>791</fpage><lpage>798</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Surg Gynecol Obstet||122|791||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5934190</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fox</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Leek</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name><surname>Weekes</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Whitehouse</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gatter</surname><given-names>KG</given-names></name><name><surname>Harris</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quantitation and prognostic value of breast cancer angiogenesis: Comparison of microvessel density, Chalkley count, and computer image analysis</article-title><source>J Pathol</source><year>1995</year><volume>177</volume><fpage>275</fpage><lpage>283</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Pathol||177|275||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8551390</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name